SmartSessionERC7739::differentialVectors
├── given the reference vectors
│   ├── when the account's eip712Domain is read
│   │   └── it matches the domain the vectors were signed for
│   ├── when the suite's helpers hash each vector
│   │   └── they agree with the reference contents, app hash, typehash and digest
│   ├── when each reference-signed envelope is validated
│   │   └── it returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE, or INVALID_SIGNATURE for a sorted TypedDataSign over a type whose dependency sorts first
│   ├── when each reference-signed envelope is validated through the account
│   │   └── it returns the same result
│   ├── when a byte of encodeData is flipped
│   │   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
│   └── when a bit of the session key signature is flipped
│       └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
